<h1 class="page-title">Sound Design</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Game audio: sound design, music and implementation.</p>

<p>I make the sounds for games, and the systems that make them react: foley and creature sounds, adaptive music, interfaces, and the Blueprints, scripts and FMOD events that tie it all to what the player is doing. Most of this work comes from my time at RMIT, working with game and animation teams.</p>

